WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.350
Raw Drive Rush approaches.

2
00:00:01.350 --> 00:00:01.950
Crouching medium kick hits Ryu from Rush.

3
00:00:01.950 --> 00:00:03.850
Standing heavy punch links from the Rush low.

4
00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:05.750
Heavy Edge leads into the OD air grab.

5
00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:06.450
Sprint launcher extends the rebound.

6
00:00:06.450 --> 00:00:07.050
Light Vagabond Edge finishes the juggle.

7
00:00:07.050 --> 00:00:07.700
Ryu falls after the completed low conversion.
